<!--
  Chapter 16 — Strangler Fig, ACL & Monolith Migration: moving pricing out of the FoodFleet monolith.
    legacy/     the monolith's pricing and ORDERS row, as they are
    acl/        anti-corruption layer: legacy order rows to the new domain model, or quarantine
    pricing/    the PricingService seam, the legacy adapter, and three releases of pricing-service
    strangler/  the facade: legacy / shadow / canary / new routing, sticky cohorts, shadow comparison
    branch/     branch by abstraction inside the monolith (checkout), kept honest by an ArchUnit rule
    rollout/    shadow traffic for each release; big bang vs canary vs canary+fallback with an incident
    gateway/    the same routing at the edge with Spring Cloud Gateway Server Web MVC
-->
